## Function: email_analysis
Parameters:
For words in spam list, add to accumulator; measure percentage of email that is spam words

Variables:
email_lower; turn text into lower case to avoid case-sensitive matching errors
spam_score; set to 0 to initialize accumulator
found_words; set to empty list to initialize accumulator
words; addition of .split to count number of spam words in message
total_words; total number of words in message
spam_percent; percentage of spam words in message

Logic:
1. Make email into lowercase readable
2. Set spam_score to 0
3. Initialize spam words found list
4. Split words into single countable instances
5. Keep running total of words in message to calculate percentage of spam words
6. Initialize accumulator
    a. Append spam words to list

Return:
spam_score, found_words, spam_percent

